<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend buy retiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend buy retiterated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read reiterated its buy rating on Ascend Communications Inc, saying its confidence in the company's performance and the health of the networking sector overall remains unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Twelve-to-18-month price target remains $90 per share.</p>
<p>-- Outlook on Ascend for fiscal first quarter is for earnings of $0.32 per share.  &quot;We see no weakness in the firm's ability to deliver that number or subsequent numbers in the quarters to come.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-3/4 to 48-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
